    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "Saluran Keluar", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Acara tetap di dalam aplikasi; jika ingin, kirim peringatan yang sama ke pusat notifikasi ponsel Anda atau ke Telegram. Tidak ada yang wajib.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Masukkan nama topik \u2014 tidak perlu akun", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "Topik", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Notifikasi diterbitkan ke topik ini di ntfy.sh; jika hanya Anda yang mengetahui nama topik, hanya Anda yang menerimanya.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "Email", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Peringatan dikirim ke alamat email akun Anda", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Dikirim ke alamat Anda sendiri saat masuk; tidak ada rahasia yang disimpan di aplikasi.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Penerima", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Notifikasi Lintas Perangkat", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Peringatan anggota keluarga muncul di pusat notifikasi bahkan ketika aplikasi ditutup", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "Masuk ke pusat notifikasi anggota lain dan perangkat Anda yang lain; penerima harus mengaktifkan saluran ini di perangkat mereka.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST ke server Anda sendiri \u2014 lanjutan", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "URL HTTPS", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Hanya HTTPS yang diterima; setiap peristiwa dikirim sebagai {source, id, title, detail, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
