    "Sessiz saatlerde d\u0131\u015fa d\u00f6n\u00fck kanallar durur; uyar\u0131lar uygulama i\u00e7inde birikmeye devam eder.": "Selama jam hening, saluran keluar dijeda; peringatan tetap terkumpul di dalam aplikasi.", // EN: During quiet hours outbound channels pause; alerts keep accumulating inside the app.
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar sessiz saatleri a\u015fs\u0131n": "Biarkan peringatan kritis melewati jam hening", // EN: Let critical alerts bypass quiet hours
    "G\u00fcvenlik, acil durum ve alarm olaylar\u0131 bu saatlerde de bildirilir.": "Keamanan, darurat, dan peristiwa alarm tetap dikirim selama jam-jam tersebut.", // EN: Security, emergency and alarm events are still delivered during those hours.
    "Ses ve Titre\u015fim": "Suara dan Getaran", // EN: Sound and Vibration
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar her zaman sesli gelir. Titre\u015fim yaln\u0131zca telefonda ge\u00e7erlidir; Android'de ses ve titre\u015fim ayr\u0131ca telefonun bildirim ayarlar\u0131ndan da de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir.": "Peringatan kritis selalu berbunyi. Getaran hanya berlaku pada ponsel; di Android, suara dan getaran juga dapat diubah di pengaturan notifikasi sistem.", // EN: Critical alerts always sound. Vibration applies on phones only; on Android, sound and vibration can also be changed in the system notification settings.
