    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS arka planda a\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n.": "Luncurkan NEXUS di latar belakang saat komputer Anda dinyalakan.", // EN: Launch NEXUS in the background when your computer starts.
