    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Akun, profil, dan data yang disinkronkan Anda telah dihapus secara permanen. Jika Anda memiliki langganan NEXUS+ aktif, batalkan terlebih dahulu dari Penagihan. Ini tidak bisa dibatalkan.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Apakah Anda yakin? Ketuk lagi untuk menghapus", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Menghapus\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Akun dihapus. Ingat untuk membatalkan langganan Anda dari akun Whop Anda.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Akun dan data Anda telah dihapus.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "Untuk menghapus data NEXUS di perangkat ini, Pengaturan \u2192 Keluar sudah cukup; tidak ada akun cloud.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Penghapusan akun di sisi server belum diterapkan. Anda bisa keluar untuk sekarang.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! Saya telah mengaktifkan Jangan Ganggu; tidak ada notifikasi yang akan mengganggu Anda. [TINDAKAN: AKTIFKAN_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\"skenario\" dapat dijalankan dengan satu ketukan dari kartu Tap to Run di layar beranda untuk saat ini. Setelah NEXUS tersedia di App Store, Anda akan bisa menambahkannya ke Siri langsung dari layar ini.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
