    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Ketik alamat IP perangkat dan NEXUS akan menentukan protokol yang digunakan.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Periksa koneksi Wi-Fi perangkat dan router Anda. Jika masalah berlanjut, hapus perangkat dan tambahkan lagi. Langkah: Perangkat > pilih perangkat > Hapus.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Periksa koneksi Wi-Fi perangkat dan router Anda. Jika masalah berlanjut, hapus perangkat dari aplikasi NEXUS dan tambahkan lagi.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Jika perangkat Anda tidak muncul, gunakan pemindaian QR atau kode pengaturan. Anda dapat membuka halaman bantuan untuk dukungan dan panduan.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Layanan lokasi (GPS) perangkat Anda mati. Hidupkan dan coba lagi.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
