    "Mesajlar \u015fifreli olarak g\u00f6nderilir ve saklan\u0131r. Bu evin \u00fcyeleri d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda kimse okuyamaz; ev silinirse mesajlar da silinir.": "Pesan dikirim dan disimpan secara terenkripsi. Tidak ada orang di luar anggota rumah ini yang dapat membacanya; jika rumah dihapus, pesan juga akan dihapus.", // EN: Messages are sent and stored encrypted. Nobody outside this home's members can read them; if the home is deleted, the messages are deleted too.
    "Daveti G\u00f6nder": "Kirim Undangan", // EN: Send Invite
    "Sahipli\u011fi Devret": "Alihkan Kepemilikan", // EN: Transfer Ownership
    "Uygulama kapal\u0131yken aile mesaj\u0131 ve ev sahibinin payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 uyar\u0131lar gelir. Ana anahtar, kategori ve sessiz saat ayarlar\u0131n sunucuya kopyalan\u0131r; uygulamay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda g\u00fcncellenir.": "Pesan keluarga dan peringatan yang dibagikan pemilik rumah tiba saat aplikasi ditutup. Sakelar utama, kategori, dan pengaturan jam senyap Anda disalin ke server; mereka diperbarui saat Anda membuka aplikasi.", // EN: Family messages and the alerts the home owner shares arrive while the app is closed. Your master switch, category and quiet-hours settings are copied to the server; they update when you open the app.
