    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "Jika alamat ini terkait dengan akun, tautan reset telah dikirim. Periksa kotak masuk Anda (dan folder spam).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
